    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in\u00a0SnaPaul 2, the second chapter of the SnaPaul saga\u2014a first-person psychological horror game that traps you in a dark, mysterious house filled with unexpected horrors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a prank gone horribly wrong, you're ensnared in a nightmarish loop crafted by your own mother. As you uncover her twisted past, the line between reality and madness begins to blur. This sequel is directly connected to the story of the first game, expanding its disturbing universe and revealing deeper secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel sinister truths, confront malevolent forces, and experience a horror journey you won\u2019t forget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense Psychological Horror</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging Storyline connected to the original SnaPaul</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short but Impactful Gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to discover what lurks in the darkness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mind and courage will be tested in SnaPaul 2.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brace your nerves\u2014once you enter, you\u2019ll never be the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; Note: This game contains graphic violence and disturbing imagery, including depictions of mutilation. Player discretion is advised.</p>",
